{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411250","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1241125001:1":{"text":"히히, 안 줄 거야. 이건 소니아 언니에게 줄 거니까!","source_cn":"嘻嘻，才不给你呢，这是给索尼娅姐姐的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF942505E76C0202","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"히히, 안 줄 거야. 이건 소니아 언니에게 줄 거니까!","female":"히히, 안 줄 거야. 이건 소니아 언니에게 줄 거니까!","variant_male_record_index":"136137","variant_female_record_index":"136138","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241125002:1":{"text":"조, 조개껍데기잖아요? 해변에 널린 건데요! 치피도 주울 수 있어요!","source_cn":"不、不就是贝壳吗？这里的沙滩上到处都是，满满也捡了一些呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EDB4F796BF2560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241125003:1":{"text":"이건 인형 눈으로 쓸 아주 예쁜 조개란 말이야!","source_cn":"这是给布娃娃做眼睛用的，漂亮贝壳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BB686BD489C850","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241125004:1":{"text":"소니아 언니, 인형 두 개 더 만들어서 하나씩 나눠 갖자. 종이배에 태워서 새로운 집으로 가는 거야!","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐，我们再做两个布娃娃吧，一个你，一个我！坐上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8337001C139CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241125005:1":{"text":"...그래.","source_cn":"……好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E921614372D42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1241125005":{"text":"...그래.","source_cn":"……好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E921614372D42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241125006:1":{"text":"나라를 데리고 해변에 가서 종이배를 띄우곤 했지. 거기에 나와 나라의 인형을 태우고... 종이배가 저 멀리 바다를 가로지르는 상상을 했어.","source_cn":"我以前会带奈拉去海边放纸船。纸船上放上我和她的布娃娃，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C54BF680F479C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241125007:1":{"text":"그리고 그 종이배가 닿은 곳이 우리의 새집이 되는 거야.","source_cn":"纸船所到达的地方，将是我们的新家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C4038A2921C7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241125008:1":{"text":"왜 새로운 집을 원하는 거죠?","source_cn":"你们为什么想去新家？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x986B3F67BC305D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241125009:1":{"text":"그때 우리는 정말 힘들었거든. 항상 배가 고팠고 괴롭힘을 당했어.","source_cn":"那时候我们过得很辛苦，经常饿肚子，被欺负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DC6A1A4980B95D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241125010:1":{"text":"나라가 쓰레기 더미에서 주운 낡은 책에는 바다 건너에 모두가 잘 먹고 따뜻하게 살 수 있는 왕국이 있다고 적혀 있었지.","source_cn":"奈拉从垃圾堆里捡来的旧书说，海的对面有个王国，每个人都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84477251DADB54AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241125011:1":{"text":"그걸 본 후 러스트 항을 떠나 그곳으로 가고 싶어했어.","source_cn":"她很想离开锈锚港，去那个地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x168DDABBF1E6FF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241125012:1":{"text":"하지만 배표는 너무 비쌌지. 그래서 난 나라에게 종이배를 접으라고 했어.","source_cn":"但是船票太贵，所以我让她折纸船，告诉她，等她折到——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC55CADD087366F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241125013:1":{"text":"종이배를 9,999개 접으면 배표로 바꿀 수 있다고 하면서 말이야!","source_cn":"等我折到第九千九百九十九只纸船，就可以兑换一张船票！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD301CB1FE4DC39A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241125014:1":{"text":"...맞아.","source_cn":"……没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6406C10124F2F5AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1241125015:1":{"text":"그러니까 나라는, 지금도 그 말을 믿고 종이배를 접고 있는 거군요...","source_cn":"所以奈拉，她到现在还相信折纸船……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C8490934D3AC824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1241125016:1":{"text":"벌써 5천 개를 접었어! 9,999개를 접으면 소니아 언니와 러스트 항을 떠나서 행복하게 살 거야!","source_cn":"我已经折了五千只了！等折到九千九百九十九，我就可以和索...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F461EDD7FF88DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1241125017:1":{"text":"소니아 언니, 나 이제 종이배를 더 빨리 접을 수 있게 됐어!","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐，我现在折纸船的速度可快了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6907C200297309D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1241125018:1":{"text":"우리 이따가 해변에 가서 종이배 띄울까?","source_cn":"待会！我们去海边放纸船吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE7F7D86F4FB2EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1241125019:1":{"text":"왠지 모르겠지만, 언니랑 같이 종이배를 띄운 게 정말 오래된 일인 것 같아!","source_cn":"不知道为什么，总感觉有好久好久，没有和你放纸船了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4534114FA9BD3592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1241125020:1":{"text":"그래...","source_cn":"好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B674650C95203CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1241125021:1":{"text":"앗, 소니아 언니! 눈 가늘게 뜨지 마!","source_cn":"哎呀，索尼娅姐姐，不要垂着眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2C8085623E773A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1241125022:1":{"text":"언니가 그랬잖아. 눈을 가늘게 뜨면 행복이 눈꺼풀 사이에서 빠져나온다면서!","source_cn":"你告诉过我，经常垂眼睛，快乐会从眼皮上悄悄跑掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x171313631F6AB000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1241125023:1":{"text":"...내가 한 말을 기억하고 있어?","source_cn":"……我是说过，你还记得？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x454F8CD62D8549E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1241125024:1":{"text":"당연하지. 언니가 한 말은 전부 기억하고 있다고!","source_cn":"当然啦，你说的每句话我都记得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDC36BAD31D09412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1241125025:1":{"text":"언니가 없을 때 낯선 사람과 이야기하지 않기. 어두운 곳에서 인형 바느질하지 말기. 채소 편식하지 말기...","source_cn":"你不在家的时候不要跟陌生人说话，不要在昏暗的地方缝布娃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C94E0521551652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1241125026:1":{"text":"전부 잊을 리가 없잖아!","source_cn":"我怎么可能忘记！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD79CBD1BD39F193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1241125027:1":{"text":"...내가 잊은 거구나. 미안해.","source_cn":"……是我忘记了，对不起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34599BE7F634E029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1241125028:1":{"text":"언니, 내가 뭔가 말실수라도 했어? 왜 그렇게 기분이 안 좋아?","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐！我说错什么了吗？你为什么不开心？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A85CDC02F2E6B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1241125029:1":{"text":"아니야... 사실, 정말 즐거워.","source_cn":"没有……我其实，很开心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CCDFBA017B2EEF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1241125030:1":{"text":"가자. 내가 많은 걸 잊어버린 모양이니까, 우리 이야기 좀 할까?","source_cn":"来吧，让我们多聊聊，我忘记了很多事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F5DD8AB1B96676","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1241125031:1":{"text":"내가 기억할 수 있게 도와줘...","source_cn":"请你帮我慢慢想起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB78786BA71A47C10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"인형?","source_cn":"布娃娃？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F503531ECFBFA4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"인형?","female":"인형?","variant_male_record_index":"66526","variant_female_record_index":"66527","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"새로운 집?","source_cn":"新家？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB6186C6142596E56","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"새로운 집?","female":"새로운 집?","variant_male_record_index":"66528","variant_female_record_index":"66529","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":35,"localized_text_count":34,"speaker_count":4}}